<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8732" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏactĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		cogo (post-Aug. and rare). * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A collecting</i>, <i>calling in</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coactiones argentarias factitavit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp. 1</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An abridgment</i> or <i>epitome of a
				discourse</i>, <i><span class="en">Inst. 4,
			15</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A disease of animals</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Veg. Art. Vet. 2, 9, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2,
				10, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 15, 5</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
